# kpods: the pods of every cluster in one picker, the ones that need attention first
Output docs/kpods.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1300
Set Height 640
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 80ms
Hide
Type "export PS1='demo $ ' && clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show
Type "kpods"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Down
Sleep 2500ms
Down
Sleep 2500ms
Type "worker"
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 2500ms
Escape
Sleep 500ms
